<title>UK: NordLB prices 1.5 billion mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB prices 1.5 billion mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following redenominatable bond was announced by joint lead managers BGB, BayerLB, CDC, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, NordLB, Trinkaus und Burkhardt and WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.50	MATURITY    20.JUN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.29     PAY DATE    20.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25 BP     REOFFER    99.12     SPREAD	+18 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 DENOMS (K) 10	  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.08	SELL CONC   0.17</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REDENOMINATION-INTO-EUROS CLAUSE.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
